{"id": "126649", "name": "Linear_FO_ODE 5", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">מצאו את הפתרון הכללי של המשוואה הדיפרנציאלית</p>\n<p>\\[ {{CT:0}}x(x^{{CT:1}}+{{CT:2}}y)=y'\\]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">השתמשו באות</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">c</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">כדי לציין את הקבוע</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">y(x) = [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "c(t):=C*t;\n\nan1:ev(ans1,tt=3);\nvarsl:listofvars(expand(an1));\nbvars:sort(listify(setdifference(setify(varsl),setify([x,c]))));\nan1:expand(an1);\n\nwvars:setify([X,t,T,x1,X1,x2,X2]);\nwcon:setify([C1,k1,K1,A,a,C])\n\nfor i:1 while i<=length(bvars) do (if elementp(bvars[i],wvars) then  an1:ev(an1,bvars[i]=x) else (if elementp(bvars[i],wcon) then  an1:ev(an1,bvars[i]=c)));\n\ncor:expand(ev(diff(an1,x)-n1*x*(x^n4+n3*an1),simp));\ncnst:ev(diff(an1,c)^2+diff(an1,C)^2);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "cor", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.7